(Here is a special case.  A vendor is sometimes an enemy, so this archetype
 needs to go in both a Vendor room and in the enemies list.)
[dir:
  :article: "a "
  :name: "vendor"
  :attack: #7
  :strength: #14
  :weaponbreaks: False ]
(So one copy goes in the room...)
DUP 'Archetypes.Room.Vendor.enemy STO
(And the other goes into our Enemies list.)
+ 'Archetypes.Enemies STO

[dir:
  :Gold:
    [dir:
      :desc: "gold pieces"
      :icon: "G"
      :get:
        ::
          Player.gold #10 rollone + 'Player.gold STO
          "You now have " Player.gold + "." + DISP ; ]
  :Flares:
    [dir:
      :desc: "flares"
      :icon: "F"
      :get:
